     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have built a basic app on shiny which connects to Hadoop and run the query to fetch the results. I have set of filters too.<div>Now when I set a certain filter, I get for ex: 5000 rows and now I need to generate a random sample of 500 observations and generate an excel.</div><div><br></div><div>My UI would be something like this:</div><div><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;observations&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n         label </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Number of observations:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n         min </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">10</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n         max </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n         value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">500</span></code></pre><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\"><br></span></code></pre><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\"><br></span></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>Any suggestions on how to proceed.</div></div>"
